  m_text: "EHEMPLO \r\n[English translation ]   Example \r\nPangngalan (Noun)\r\nKahulugan
    (Tagalog): Modelo o halimbawa na sinusundan.\n\r\nMeaning (English): A model
    or example to follow.\r\n\rHalimbawa (Filipino): Siya ang magandang ehemplo para
    sa kabataan.\r\nExample (English): She is a good example for the youth.\r\n"
