  m_text: "EDUKADO \r\n[English translation ]  Educated \r\nPang-uri (Adjective)\r\nKahulugan
    (Tagalog): Taong may sapat na kaalaman o nakatapos ng pag-aaral.\r\n Meaning
    (English): Someone with enough knowledge or completed education.\r\n\r\nHalimbawa
    (Filipino): Edukado ang gurong nagtuturo sa amin.\r\nExample (English): The teacher
    who teaches us is well-educated.\r\n"
