  m_text: "KAHOY\r\n[English translation ]    Wood \r\nPangngalan (Noun)\r\nKahulugan
    (Tagalog): Matigas na bahagi ng puno, madalas ginagamit sa paggawa.\r\n Meaning
    (English): The hard part of a tree, often used for making things.\r\n\r\n Halimbawa
    (Filipino): Maraming upuan ang gawa sa kahoy.\r\n Example (English): Many chairs
    are made of wood.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
