  m_text: "DALAGA \r\n[English translation ]   Maiden \r\nPangngalan (Noun)\r\nKahulugan
    (Tagalog): Babaeng nasa hustong gulang ngunit wala pang asawa.\r\n Meaning (English):
    A young adult female who is not yet married.\r\n\r\nHalimbawa (Filipino): Maganda
    ang dalagang nakita ko kahapon.\r\nExample (English): The maiden I saw yesterday
    is beautiful.\r\n"
