  m_text: "KANTA\r\n[English translation]   Song \r\nPangngalan (Noun)\r\nKahulugan
    (Tagalog): Komposisyong may himig at liriko na inaawit.\r\n Meaning (English):
    A musical composition with melody and lyrics that is sung.\r\n\r\nHalimbawa (Filipino):
    Maganda ang kantang narinig ko sa radyo.\r\nExample (English): The song I heard
    on the radio is beautiful.\r\n"
